OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 29 NOV
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,9,     GTom Service with the perfect
OL,10,     Gclassical soundtrack! The
OL,11,     Gastounding pianist Hiromi
OL,12,     Gperforms an exclusive session,
OL,13,     Gplus live music from ZRI and Tom
OL,14,     Gchats to composer Errollyn Wallen.
OL,15,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,16,     GJools is joined by saxophonist,
OL,17,     Gbandleader and composer YolanDa
OL,18,     GBrown.
OL,19,G1300FMusic Matters: In the Beginning
OL,20,     GComposer James MacMillan explores
OL,21,     Gmusic inspired by the biblical
OL,22,     Gstory of creation.
